Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3-all, python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/sgk-dev/wordwrap

Package: sgk-wordwrap
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, wl-clipboard, python3-pyqt6, python3-evdev
Recommends: xclip, xdotool, python3-xlib
Description: Fix text typed in the wrong keyboard layout (GNOME Wayland)
 WordWrap rewrites selected text through the other keyboard layout on a
 hotkey and switches the system layout to match. Manual by design: it
 never watches what you type. Targets GNOME Shell on Wayland.
